      "claimKind": "theorem",
      "displayLabel": "定理 9",
      "shortTitle": "Seifert 几何判别",
      "title": "Seifert 纤维化流形的模型几何判别定理",
      "statement": "设 $M$ 是闭、连通、可定向的 Seifert 纤维化三维流形，底 orbifold 为 $B$，Seifert Euler 数为 $e(M)$。若 $\\chi^{\\mathrm{orb}}(B)>0$，则 $e(M)=0$ 时 $M$ 承载 $S^2\\times\\mathbb{R}$ 几何，$e(M)\\neq0$ 时承载 $S^3$ 几何；若 $\\chi^{\\mathrm{orb}}(B)=0$，则相应地承载 $\\mathbb{E}^3$ 或 Nil 几何；若 $\\chi^{\\mathrm{orb}}(B)<0$，则相应地承载 $\\mathbb{H}^2\\times\\mathbb{R}$ 或 $\\widetilde{\\mathrm{SL}}_2(\\mathbb{R})$ 几何。",
      "sourceReference": "Scott, The geometries of 3-manifolds (1983), Seifert geometry classification",
      "chapterIds": ["jsj:chapter:geometrization"],
      "sourcePath": "examples/generic-math-content/jsj-decomposition-project-view.json#seifert-classification"
    },
